# Route: guide 44 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to
# 59, 46 quests, 2.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tanaris, Burning Steppes, Duskwood, Stranglethorn Vale, Ashenvale,
# Western Plaguelands, Hillsbrad Foothills, Silverpine Forest): Gadgetzan ->
# Broken Pillar -> Lost Rigger Cove -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Darkshire ->
# Wild Shore -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Booty Bay -> Grom'gol Base Camp ->
# Night Run -> Felfire Hill -> Felstone Field -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Nothing But The Truth (1383;
# Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider Searcher 39-40); The Star, the Hand and
# the Heart (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the
# Undying 44); The Crown of Will (520; Mug'thol 43); Assault on Fenris Isle
# (442; Thule Ravenclaw 24).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll
# Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The
# Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets
# (4788), Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024), Precarious
# Predicament (4121), The Heart of the Mountain (4123), Egg Freezing (4734),
# Egg Collection (4735), Blackfathom Villainy (6561), Allegiance to the Old
# Gods (6565), Allegiance to the Old Gods (6565), Amongst the Ruins (6921),
# Amongst the Ruins (6921), Baron Aquanis (6922), Doctor Theolen Krastinov,
# the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus
# Illusions (6569), The Grave Knight (96986), Arugal Must Die (1014), Arugal
# Must Die (1014), Into The Scarlet Monastery (1048), Deathstalkers in
# Shadowfang (1098), Deathstalkers in Shadowfang (1098), The Power to
# Destroy... (5725), The New Plague (95216), Heart of Disruption (96984),
# Source of Power (96988).

